# How a message moves: new, seen, working, done; seen or working can stop at blocked / declined.
direction: right
new: { shape: rectangle; label: |md **new**<br/>just arrived | }
seen: { shape: rectangle; label: |md **seen**<br/>you saw it | }
working: { shape: rectangle; label: |md **working**<br/>in progress | }
done: { shape: rectangle; class: accent; label: |md **done**<br/>handled | }
blocked: { shape: rectangle; class: dim; label: |md **blocked / declined**<br/>reason in the note | }
new -> seen
seen -> working
working -> done: "" {class: accent}
seen -> blocked: "" {class: dash}
working -> blocked: "" {class: dash}
